q4: $ G , t8 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons m (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_s , scons t7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 o p n ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ t8 = ⟨ k1 , j1 ⟩ $ by weaken [#4]
