q7: $ G , t8 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons m (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_s , scons t7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 o p n ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ t7 ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#7]
q8: $ G , t8 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons m (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_s , scons t7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 o p n ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ r0 ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
q9: $ G , t8 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons m (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_s , scons t7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 o p n ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ∀ z (z ∊ x0 → ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ v (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t8 w r0 ∧ z = nest f v)) $ by weaken [#9]
q10: $ G , t8 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons m (scons n ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_s , scons t7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 o p n ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ∀ f ∀ g ∀ t ∀ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t8 w r0 → a ∊ fseq u → apn x0 f ∈ apn (fv r0 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf t7) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf t5))) a) $ by weaken [#10]
