c2_x6: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) $ by ax
c2_y6: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c2_x6, c2_y7]
c2_x5: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) $ by ax
c2_y5: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c2_x5, c2_y6]
c2_x4: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) $ by ax
c2_y4: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c2_x4, c2_y5]
c2_x3: $ G , ∃ x9 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) ⇒ ∃ x9 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) $ by ax
c2_y3: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c2_x3, c2_y4]
c2_x2: $ G , ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) ⇒ ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) $ by ax
c2_y2: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c2_x2, c2_y3]
c2_x1: $ G , ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) ⇒ ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (iprt td x7 x8 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u E x7 w ∧ ictk td j c x9 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x9 w (scat x1 (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ x6 ∊ scons c x3 ∧ z = nest (scat x2 x1) x6) $ by ax
c2_y1: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c2_x1, c2_y2]
c2: $ … ⇒ ∃ p ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (p ∊ esat u E tp w ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat p (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) ∧ z = nest p (nest f y)) $ by ex_elim [c1r, c2_y1]

lemma e4_pt (G: hyps) (E: class) (u w td tp tt j c tk q f g t a: set): $ G ⇒ (ifam u E td w) ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ > $ G ⇒ q ∊ esat u E tp w $ > $ G ⇒ ictk td j c tk $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat q (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $
----
a1: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
w1: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ (ifam u E td w) ∈ u $ by weaken [#1]
w2: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ by weaken [#2]
w3: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ q ∊ esat u E tp w $ by weaken [#3]
w4: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ictk td j c tk $ by weaken [#4]
w5: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat q (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) $ by weaken [#5]
w6: $ G , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#6]
a2: $ … ⇒ z ∊ iop0 u E td w (ifam u E td w) $ by iop0_intro [w2, w3, w4, w5, w6, a1]
a3: $ … ⇒ iop0 u E td w (ifam u E td w) ⊆ (ifam u E td w) $ by ifam_closed [w1]
a4: $ … ⇒ z ∊ (ifam u E td w) $ by subset_elim [a3, a2]
a5: $ … ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by wcel_intro [a1, a4]
a6: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
a7: $ … ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by isset_elim [a6, a5]

lemma e4_hb1 (G: hyps) (E: class) (u w td tp tt j c tk q f g t a: set): $ G ⇒ td ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ (ifam u E td w) ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ > $ G ⇒ q ∊ esat u E tp w $ > $ G ⇒ ictk td j c tk $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat q (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $
----
m1: $ … ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by e4_pt [#2, #3, #4, #5, #6, #7]
kx: $ G , x = scons c g ⇒ x = scons c g $ by ax
rj: $ G , x = scons c g ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
ra: $ G , x = scons c g ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
m2: $ … ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [rj, opair_eq [ra, kx]]
m3: $ G , x = scons c g ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by weaken [m1]
m4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by wcel_eq_l [eq_sym [m2], m3]
p1: $ G , x = scons c g , iprop td j w ⇒ iprop td j w $ by ax
p2: $ … ⇒ (ictor u E td j c w) = ∅ $ by ictor_prop [p1]
p3: $ G , x = scons c g , iprop td j w ⇒ scat f q = scat f q $ by eq_refl
p3a: $ G , x = scons c g , iprop td j w ⇒ apn ∅ (scat f q) = ∅ $ by e4_apn_empty
p4: $ … ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) = ∅ $ by eq_trans [apn_eq [p2, p3], p3a]
p5: $ G , x = scons c g , iprop td j w ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by weaken [m4]
p6: $ … ⇒ nest a ∅ ∈ (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) $ by ient_intro_prop [p5, p1]
p7: $ G , x = scons c g , iprop td j w ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
p8a: $ … ⇒ ∅ ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a ↔ nest a ∅ ∈ (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) $ by apn_wcel [p7]
p8: $ … ⇒ ∅ ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $ by bi_elim_r [p8a, p6]
p9: $ … ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $ by wcel_eq_l [eq_sym [p4], p8]
n1: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ ¬ iprop td j w $ by ax
v1: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ td ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
v3: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ by weaken [#3]
v4: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ q ∊ esat u E tp w $ by weaken [#4]
v5: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ ictk td j c tk $ by weaken [#5]
v6: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E tk w (scat q (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) $ by weaken [#6]
n2: $ … ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) = scons c g $ by ictor_apn_c [welc_wcel [v1], n1, v3, welc_wcel [v4], v5, v6]
n3a: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u E td w) $ by weaken [m4]
n3: $ … ⇒ nest a x ∈ (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) $ by ient_intro [n3a, n1]
n4a: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
n4: $ … ⇒ x ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a ↔ nest a x ∈ (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) $ by apn_wcel [n4a]
n5: $ … ⇒ x ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $ by bi_elim_r [n4, n3]
n6a: $ G , x = scons c g , ¬ iprop td j w ⇒ x = scons c g $ by ax
n6: $ … ⇒ x = apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) $ by eq_trans [n6a, eq_sym [n2]]
n7: $ … ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $ by wcel_eq_l [n6, n5]
o1: $ G , x = scons c g ⇒ iprop td j w ∨ ¬ iprop td j w $ by excluded_middle
o2: $ … ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $ by or_elim [o1, p9, n7]
o3a: $ G ⇒ isset g $ by isset_var
o3: $ … ⇒ isset (scons c g) $ by scons_set [o3a]
o4: $ … ⇒ apn (ictor u E td j c w) (scat f q) ∈ apn (ient td w (ifam u E td w) j) a $ by isset_elim [o3, o2]

lemma e4_ha2 {f g t a y: set} (G: hyps) (E Y: class) (u w td tp tt j c tk q z: set): $ G ⇒ z ∊ apn (ictor u E td j c w) q $ > $ G ⇒ iprt td tp tt $ > $ G ⇒ ictk td j c tk $ > $ G ⇒ tk ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ (ixs td w (ifam u E td w)) ∈ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ q ∊ esat u E tp w $ > $ G ⇒ tp ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ etel u E tk w (scat q (ixs td w (ifam u E td w))) = Y $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ y (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Y ∧ z = nest f y) $
